              "id": "O1Man",
              "name": "Para1",
              "fill": "#1A2E28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "陆沉握紧青铜残剑，指腹摩挲过剑身凹凸的铭文。观星台外，夜风卷起碎石，像有人在低声念一段被遗忘的咒文。",
              "lineHeight": 1.85,
              "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "nYLnf",
              "name": "Para2",
              "fill": "#1A2E28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "「第七星渊」——这三个字在他眼前忽然亮起，像墨迹被无形的手重新描了一遍。远处山脊上，一盏青灯忽明忽灭。",
              "lineHeight": 1.85,
              "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "IybIQ",
              "name": "Section/AIResult",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$color/primary/soft",
              "cornerRadius": "$radius/lg",
              "stroke": "$color/primary",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "sn4yt",
                  "name": "AIHead",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "justifyContent": "space_between",
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "BKlxs",
                      "name": "AITag",
                      "gap": 6,
                      "alignItems": "center",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "icon",
                          "id": "S6zu3e",
                          "name": "AIIcon2",
                          "width": 14,
                          "height": 14,
                          "icon": "sparkles",
                          "library": "lucide",
                          "fill": "#1B6B5A"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "Isa4J",
                          "name": "AITagText",
                          "fill": "#1B6B5A",
                          "content": "AI 续写完毕 · DeepSeek",
                          "fontFamily": "Geist",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ngmgi",
                      "name": "AITokens",
                      "fill": "#8A9A93",
                      "content": "约 420 tokens",
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "g6uzep",
                  "name": "AIText",
                  "fill": "#1A2E28",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "他循着青灯走去。石阶尽头立着一座坍塌的牌坊，匾额上「星渊」二字裂成两半。牌坊后，一道人影背对他而立，衣袂猎猎，像是等了很久。\n\n「你终于来了，执剑人。」那人没有回头，「铭文会带你去真正的第七星渊——但你得先回答我：你愿意用什么，换回仙道？」",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "sWpbu",
